msgid "OpenEMS: Third-party systems on OpenEMS"
msgstr "OpenEMS: Fremdsysteme an OpenEMS"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/third-party/overview.adoc
msgid ""
"This page compares three widely used systems that work together with "
"OpenEMS: **Home Assistant**, **evcc** and **openWB**. All three are "
"independent projects and not part of OpenEMS. Details are on the pages "
"xref:user/third-party/home-assistant.adoc[Home Assistant], xref:user/third-"
"party/evcc.adoc[evcc] and xref:user/third-party/openwb.adoc[openWB]. The "
"basis in each case is their source code and the OpenEMS source code; none of "
"this has been tried out."
msgstr ""
"Diese Seite vergleicht drei verbreitete Systeme, die mit OpenEMS "
"zusammenarbeiten: **Home Assistant**, **evcc** und **openWB**. Alle drei "
"sind eigenständige Projekte und nicht Teil von OpenEMS. Einzelheiten stehen "
"auf den Seiten xref:user/third-party/home-assistant.adoc[Home Assistant], "
"xref:user/third-party/evcc.adoc[evcc] und xref:user/third-party/"
"openwb.adoc[openWB]. Grundlage ist jeweils deren Quellcode und der OpenEMS-"
"Quellcode; ausprobiert wurde nichts davon."

