#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/third-party/overview.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "What to consider when combining"
msgstr "Was man beim Kombinieren beachten sollte"

#. type: #sec-what-to-consider-when-combining
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/third-party/overview.adoc
msgid ""
"**Only one system controls the storage.** If Home Assistant, evcc and a "
"control function in OpenEMS (e.g. xref:user/storage-control/time-of-use-"
"tariffs.adoc[time-of-use tariff]) issue specifications at the same time, the "
"strictest limit applies in each case. The result is then difficult to "
"understand."
msgstr ""
"**Nur ein System steuert den Speicher.** Wenn Home Assistant, evcc und eine "
"Steuerfunktion in OpenEMS (z. B. xref:user/storage-control/time-of-use-"
"tariffs.adoc[dynamischer Stromtarif]) gleichzeitig Vorgaben machen, gilt "
"jeweils die strengste Grenze. Das Ergebnis ist dann schwer nachzuvollziehen."

#. type: #sec-what-to-consider-when-combining
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/third-party/overview.adoc
msgid ""
"**Only one system controls surplus charging.** evcc, openWB and xref:user/ev-"
"charging-control/surplus-charging.adoc[surplus charging in OpenEMS] see the "
"same surplus. If two of them run on the same wallbox or on different "
"wallboxes without coordination, they work against each other."
msgstr ""
"**Nur ein System regelt das Überschussladen.** evcc, openWB und das "
"xref:user/ev-charging-control/surplus-charging.adoc[Überschussladen in "
"OpenEMS] sehen denselben Überschuss. Laufen zwei davon auf dieselbe Wallbox "
"oder auf verschiedene Wallboxen ohne Absprache, regeln sie gegeneinander."

#. type: #sec-what-to-consider-when-combining
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/third-party/overview.adoc
msgid ""
"**OpenEMS limits always apply.** Emergency reserve, battery and grid limits, "
"and xref:user/storage-control/section-14a-enwg.adoc[§ 14a] restrict any "
"external specification (see xref:user/systems/fenecon-home-"
"battery.adoc[FENECON Home battery])."
msgstr ""
"**Grenzen von OpenEMS gelten immer.** Notstromreserve, Batterie- und "
"Netzgrenzen, xref:user/storage-control/section-14a-enwg.adoc[§ 14a] "
"schränken jede Vorgabe von außen ein (siehe xref:user/systems/fenecon-home-"
"battery.adoc[FENECON-Home-Batterie])."

#. type: #sec-what-to-consider-when-combining
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/third-party/overview.adoc
msgid ""
"**Fixed names.** evcc and openWB mainly read `+_sum+`, openWB additionally "
"the fixed `+meter0+` and `+ess0+`. If the naming differs, the values are not "
"correct."
msgstr ""
"**Feste Namen.** evcc und openWB lesen vor allem `+_sum+`, openWB zusätzlich "
"fest `+meter0+` und `+ess0+`. Bei abweichender Benennung stimmen die Werte "
"nicht."

#. type: #sec-what-to-consider-when-combining
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/third-party/overview.adoc
msgid ""
"**Do not expose ports to the internet.** All three use unencrypted "
"connections in the home network; Modbus has no login at all."
msgstr ""
"**Ports nicht ins Internet freigeben.** Alle drei nutzen im Heimnetz "
"unverschlüsselte Verbindungen; Modbus ganz ohne Anmeldung."

#. type: #sec-what-to-consider-when-combining
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/third-party/overview.adoc
msgid ""
"**Load from queries.** Each connection queries regularly. This is not "
"critical at the intervals described here; many additional scripts with short "
"intervals increase the load on the system."
msgstr ""
"**Lasten durch Abfragen.** Jede Anbindung fragt regelmäßig ab. Das ist bei "
"den hier beschriebenen Takten unkritisch; viele zusätzliche Skripte mit "
"kurzen Takten erhöhen die Last der Anlage."
